  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Controls</b>\nWASD move \xB7 Shift walk (quiet) \xB7 Space jump \xB7
    Ctrl/C crouch (duck under swings)\nLMB attack / draw \xB7 RMB block, or hold
    and release to cast a readied spell \xB7 1 / 2 weapon sets \xB7 X put the weapon
    away \xB7 Tab inventory\n3 / 4 belt item in hand (press again for the next of
    three), LMB use, RMB put away \xB7 F interact (hold; chests and corpses open
    at once) \xB7 Q / E skills \xB7 G rest \xB7 M map \xB7 H help\nCasters need a
    staff, spellbook or crystal ball in hand; bards need an instrument. Rest at a
    campfire to recover charges."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
